                <pb facs="0882" n="794" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg794"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Eddy to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Eddy reports that he has communicated Department’s telegram of the 18th
                    instant to the minister for foreign affairs, and that three days will be
                    required for a formal answer.)</p>
            </div>
